# Unified, Family-Friendly Settings Hub for BriskOS 1.0 LTS (Feather)
# Pure PyGObject / GTK3 native desktop app adhering to Antislop UI rules.
# Sub-25 MB RSS RAM, <0.25s instantaneous startup, Night Glass aesthetics.
# ==============================================================================

